  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "阿爸"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><b>作者：林淑雅</b></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">自從阿母做仙了後，阿爸就家己一个人蹛。我做序細--ê無想beh強迫伊tio̍h hām阮做伙蹛，主要是阿爸跤kiānn手kiānn，人也精光，koh真知伊無想beh麻煩--阮。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">平素時我kah阿姊做伙tńg去煮暗，陪阿爸鬥陣食飯，因為阮姊妹仔蹛離阿爸khah近，若是拜六iah是節日，就hōo兄嫂kah弟婦仔in hua̍t-lo̍h。當然mā有阿爸家己ê自由時間——禮拜。若是阿爸有需要beh出外mā自由，講--一-聲，hōo阮知，thang心安就好，beh佗落在伊。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">逐íng擺，若是拄著拜一，我前跤iáu未hānn過戶tīng，阿爸就已經tī門口笑微微迎接--looh。喙若開，話就講無停，定著是講伊koh走去佗位tshit-thô，拄著啥mih趣味代。有一工，無啥tuì-tâng，入門huah阿爸，阿爸坐tī the椅攑頭掠我看--一-下koh hmh一聲就無koh講半句--ah。看阿爸hm̍h-hm̍h the tī椅仔頂，lán心肝內giâu疑，行倚去kā摸看--leh，hiau-hīng--ooh，thài ē規身軀燒hōng-hōng，磅針隨sa來磅，夭壽，真正燒kah 40度。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Tī院--裡抽血，照電光、超音波，等病床，tshia-pua̍h兩三工總算查著原因，確認是去è著社區型肺炎，也就是khah早lán所講ê「退伍軍人症」。阮teh懷疑檢采是去游泳館泅水jiám--著--ê，mā即時通報衛生所。假若知病因，就知thang對症落藥，lán只要好好仔照顧、配合治療，絕對無問題。阮四个姊弟仔sio放伴暝日看顧，阿爸mā真聽喙好款待。前前後後害阿爸受苦半月外日，總算ē-tàng出院--ah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">阮阿爸tī lán人7月初7生日，今年（編按：2020年）koh kap爸爸節差一工，本tsiânn阮就按算兩个節日beh同齊過，tshuā阿爸來去食伊上意愛ê日本料理。無疑悟suah縛tī病院。Buē-tàng照原來ê計劃（kè-i̍k）來慶祝，對阿爸實在tsiok歹勢。M̄-koh，阿爸suah安搭阮講，伊真歡喜有阮ê陪伴，比phīng山珍海tshò khah贏過濟濟。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><div><br /></div><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>#台灣人寫真 專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報322期，2021年2月出刊。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=A